1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:02,705
Welcome to DoF Paper Breakdown
这里是 DoF Paper 解读。

2
00:00:02,730 --> 00:00:06,725
Today: π0.7, a steerable robot generalist
今天讲 π0.7：可引导的机器人通用模型。

3
00:00:06,750 --> 00:00:10,605
We will unpack the VLA framework and cross robot transfer
拆解 VLA 框架与跨本体技能迁移。

4
00:00:10,630 --> 00:00:13,430
Then check the evidence behind those capabilities
再看这些能力背后的实验证据。

5
00:00:14,320 --> 00:00:19,455
Last episode, RECAP turned robot experience into better specialist policies
上一期，RECAP 用执行经验改进专用策略。

6
00:00:19,480 --> 00:00:23,795
π0.7 asks how one generalist can reuse those skills
π0.7：一个通用模型怎样复用这些技能？

7
00:00:23,820 --> 00:00:27,575
The key is richer context about what to do, and how to do it
关键是更丰富的上下文：做什么，怎样做。

8
00:00:27,600 --> 00:00:30,800
Let us read the architecture, then check the evidence
先拆框架，再看实验证据。

9
00:00:31,590 --> 00:00:33,905
Figure 2 separates three roles
图 2 把系统分成三个角色。

10
00:00:33,930 --> 00:00:37,265
The high level policy proposes a language subtask
高层策略提出语言子任务。

11
00:00:37,290 --> 00:00:40,605
The world model generates images of a near future goal
世界模型生成近期目标图像。

12
00:00:40,630 --> 00:00:45,105
The VLA sees current images, joint states, and compressed visual history
VLA 输入当前图像、关节状态和压缩历史。

13
00:00:45,130 --> 00:00:48,725
Its flow matching action expert generates motor commands
流匹配动作专家生成控制指令。

14
00:00:48,750 --> 00:00:53,870
Goal images describe the destination. The action expert chooses how to reach it
目标图像描述终点，动作专家决定怎样到达。

15
00:00:54,460 --> 00:00:56,955
Figure 3 shows the expanded prompt
图 3 展示扩展后的提示结构。

16
00:00:56,980 --> 00:01:02,075
It combines the task, a subtask, visual subgoals, and episode metadata
包含任务、子任务、视觉子目标和轨迹元数据。

17
00:01:02,100 --> 00:01:06,255
A control label selects joint space or end effector commands
控制标签选择关节空间或末端控制。

18
00:01:06,280 --> 00:01:10,940
Prompt dropout lets the model combine optional prompt components at runtime
提示随机丢弃让模型能按需组合可选输入。

19
00:01:11,730 --> 00:01:16,685
Metadata describes speed, quality, and mistakes in each training episode
元数据描述每条轨迹的速度、质量和失误。

20
00:01:16,710 --> 00:01:21,065
That distinguishes good behavior from slower or unsuccessful attempts
它把良好行为与低效、失败尝试区分开。

21
00:01:21,090 --> 00:01:25,105
At runtime, the prompt asks for high quality and no mistakes
执行时，提示指定高质量、无失误。

22
00:01:25,130 --> 00:01:29,850
Those labels steer behavior. They do not guarantee a successful outcome
标签引导行为，但不保证任务成功。

23
00:01:30,440 --> 00:01:33,015
Figure 6 connects this back to RECAP
图 6 把结果接回 RECAP。

24
00:01:33,040 --> 00:01:37,835
Training includes rollouts from specialist policies, labeled with metadata
训练纳入带元数据标签的专用策略轨迹。

25
00:01:37,860 --> 00:01:42,295
One generalist matches specialist performance on these tested tasks
同一通用模型在这些测试任务中接近专用模型。

26
00:01:42,320 --> 00:01:47,420
Read success rate and throughput separately. The latter counts successes per hour
成功率和吞吐量分开看；后者是每小时成功次数。

27
00:01:48,030 --> 00:01:51,985
Now Figure 12, and the official UR5e folding clip
图 12，结合官网 UR5e 叠衣服演示。

28
00:01:52,010 --> 00:01:55,345
There is no laundry folding data for this target robot
目标机器人没有叠衣服任务训练数据。

29
00:01:55,370 --> 00:01:58,005
It does have training data for other tasks
但它有其他任务的训练数据。

30
00:01:58,030 --> 00:02:03,285
Skills transfer from a smaller robot, with grasp strategies adapted to the larger arms
技能从较小机器人迁移，抓取策略随本体调整。

31
00:02:03,310 --> 00:02:07,285
With generated subgoals, shirt folding success is 80%
加入生成子目标后，叠恤衫成功率为 80%。

32
00:02:07,310 --> 00:02:11,670
Experienced teleoperators score 80.6% in this comparison
本次对比中，熟练遥操人员成功率为 80.6%。

33
00:02:12,420 --> 00:02:15,775
For a new air fryer task, separate three stages
新空气炸锅任务，要分清三个阶段。

34
00:02:15,800 --> 00:02:21,135
A single zero shot instruction produces only partial execution in the website example
官网示例中，一句零样本指令只完成了部分步骤。

35
00:02:21,160 --> 00:02:25,515
Step by step language coaching helps the robot complete the sequence
逐步语言指导帮助机器人完成任务序列。

36
00:02:25,540 --> 00:02:28,240
Figure 15 tests this coached setting
图 15 测试的是有人指导的设置。

37
00:02:28,810 --> 00:02:31,265
Figure 16 is the next stage
图 16 是下一阶段。

38
00:02:31,290 --> 00:02:36,525
Coaching episodes train a high level policy to generate the subtasks automatically
指导轨迹用于训练自动生成子任务的高层策略。

39
00:02:36,550 --> 00:02:42,085
That creates an autonomous task policy without new teleoperated action demonstrations
无需新增遥操动作示范，即可形成自主任务策略。

40
00:02:42,110 --> 00:02:45,745
But it uses coaching data and extra high level training
但它使用了指导数据和额外的高层训练。

41
00:02:45,770 --> 00:02:49,390
Keep that distinction when interpreting zero shot claims
解读零样本能力时，要保留这个区别。

42
00:02:50,080 --> 00:02:53,555
Figure 18 tests the data argument
图 18 是检验数据论点的重要实验。

43
00:02:53,580 --> 00:02:57,235
Adding lower quality data can hurt a model without metadata
没有元数据时，加入低质量数据可能降低表现。

44
00:02:57,260 --> 00:03:01,195
With metadata, performance improves as the dataset expands
有元数据时，表现随数据规模扩大而改善。

45
00:03:01,220 --> 00:03:06,935
Removing the most diverse 20% hurts more than removing a random 20%
移除最多样的 20%，比随机移除 20% 更伤性能。

46
00:03:06,960 --> 00:03:11,820
The amounts match, so this comparison tests diversity beyond volume
移除数量相同，因此能考察数据量之外的多样性。

47
00:03:12,470 --> 00:03:18,485
The paper reports 60–80% success for unseen tasks or robot-task combinations
论文报告：未见任务或任务本体组合成功率约 60–80%。

48
00:03:18,510 --> 00:03:22,545
Related skills may still exist elsewhere in the large training mixture
相关技能仍可能存在于庞大训练数据的其他部分。

49
00:03:22,570 --> 00:03:26,345
My reading: richer context makes diverse experience more usable
我的理解：更丰富的上下文，让多样经验更可用。

50
00:03:26,370 --> 00:03:29,865
That is the connection from RECAP to a steerable generalist
这就是从 RECAP 到可引导通用模型的联系。

51
00:03:29,890 --> 00:03:32,790
DoF Paper Breakdown · EP.02
这里是 DoF Paper 解读，第二期。
